  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "migration-utils currently migrates objects as archival groups. This is not necessarily desirable and has two potentially negative consequences:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1. The object is versioned for every change to any of its parts, causing OCFL version inflation",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. The entire object is locked whenever any part of it is updated, meaning that two binaries within the same object cannot be updated concurrently",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Example object with 121 versions from Jakov M. Vežić:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "So the original in Fedora 3 has:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "RELS-EXT: 48 versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "MODS: 18 versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "DC: 34 versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FILE0: 4 versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "TN: 5 versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "STATUS_INGEST: 7 versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FILE1: 2 versions",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FULL_TEXT: 1 version",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "inventory.json is 635K",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "migration-utils should allow the user to decide how they want their objects modeled.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
